{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48825","headline":"赠陈判官求子花诗 · 杨巨源","name":"赠陈判官求子花诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"油地轻绡碧且红，须怜纤手是良工。\n能生丽思千花外，善点穠姿五彩中。\n子细传看临霁景，殷勤持赠及春风。\n若将江上迎桃叶，一帖何妨锦绣同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48825.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48825","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}